.Dd September 3, 2026
.Dt VDOTS-READABILITY 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vdots-readability
.Nd readability report for prose on stdin, as JSON
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Aq Ar transcript.txt
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
reads prose on standard input and emits a JSON readability report using
standard formulas \(em Flesch Reading Ease and Flesch\(enKincaid grade \(em with
a vowel-group syllable heuristic. Python standard library only, no
dependencies.
.Pp
.Xr vdots-listen 1 Ic publish
pipes the session transcript through it to build the readability card on the
article page and the Readability section of
.Pa report.md .
.Sh OUTPUT
JSON object with keys:
.Ic words , sentences , syllables , polysyllabic_words ,
.Ic avg_words_per_sentence , avg_syllables_per_word , flesch_reading_ease ,
.Ic reading_ease_band , flesch_kincaid_grade ,
.Ic reading_time_min Pq at 200 wpm silent ,
.Ic listening_time_min Pq at 155 wpm follow pace ,
and
.Ic longest_sentences Bq .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr vdots 1 ,
.Xr vdots-listen 1 ,
.Xr vdots-publish 1
